        "original_id": "010682a0-9986-577b-bf90-6eea70824bbe",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lance Franklin\n- Events: 2013 AFL Goal of the Year\n- Awards: All-Australian selections, Coleman Medals\n\nFacts:\n- At the end of the 2013 AFL home-and-away season, three finalists were selected for a final public vote for the 2013 AFL Goal of the Year.\n- Lance Franklin won the final public vote for the 2013 AFL Goal of the Year with a long-range goal scored after hurdling over a teammate in the middle of the ground.\n- Lance Franklin has won seven All-Australian selections during his career, including three at full forward and four at centre half-forward.\n- Lance Franklin has won four Coleman Medals during his career.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
